window.products.push({"id":513088,"name":"Rosy Rings Round Botanical Candle Roman Lavender - Aromatherapy Candles, Luxury Candles, Long Lasting Candles, Botanical Candles, Candle Gift Sets, Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51drO7QzydL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Through the masterful blending of true lavender with vanilla and amber, let Roman's Eucalyptus & Lavender candle transport you to the calming fragrances of nature. This exquisite fragrance combines an intoxicating blend of botanicals with a sweet base note of vanilla to bring you the timeless qualities of a crisp bergamot and eucalyptus crescendo into true lavender. Romantic, seductive and sweet, Roman begins with a top note of crisp bergamot and eucalyptus. The crisp citrus is softened by lavender, and deepened with woods, amber and musk. A soothing nightcap for the senses, a relaxing lavender scent that encourages sweet dreams. With a richly scented candle that promises to fill your room with fragrance, a beautifully detailed wax vessel and an indulgent gift box, this lavender collection is as beautiful as it is aromatic. Purify your space with a natural, pure-fume candle from Roman Candle. The fresh, sophisticated top note is strengthened by a heart of earthy, woodsy lavender. The scent is then underscored by soft tones of amber, cedarwood and musk – the harmony of calming Lavender in this the candle in sweet notes of honey and is delicately finished with a blue floral bouquet of forget-me-not. Cool and refreshing, this floral blend of fresh lavender and cool bergamot with eucalyptus is crafted using pure essential oils to create an elegant aroma. Invigorate your senses with this classic, fresh scent from Roman Candle. This candle emits a soft glow that serves as a real treat for the eye as well. Measuring at 5.5\" in height and with a burn time of approximately 120 hours, this candle is an absolute must-have. The small round botanical candle burns evenly and slowly to fill a room with its exquisite fragrance. Our Roman Lavender Botanical Candle is as pretty as it is pampering. Amber, bergamot, and eucalyptus open to true lavender with vanilla, while rich notes of lavender musk unfold gently into the base. Aromatic, elegant, and a great addition that will adorn any home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51drO7QzydL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosy Rings","source_asin":"B0BWPNL582","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWPNL582","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWPNL582","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
