window.products.push({"id":513225,"name":"Heaters for Indoor Use, Portable Room Space Heater w/Remote Control, 3s Fast Heating, 3 Modes, 12H Timer, 60 Degrees Oscillation, Tip-Over and Overhea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iIYTIovUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[3s Rapid & Widespread Heat] When winter comes and you are at home, you just want to feel cozy warmth, but you can´t wait! Here comes Air Choice portable space heater. Our heater for indoor use will be your ideal winter partner. This room heater at 1500w in high mode can heat up in 3s. Plus, this electric heater for indoor use has a 60° widespread oscillation, which can warm the room and help you get rid of the cold immediately. [Meet Your Various Needs] The portable room heater has 3 adjustable temp modes: 1500w high, 1000w middle heat & natural wind.When you get home in winter, you can activate the highest mode of the space heater to make your room heat up quickly. If you don´t want to spend much energy, adjust to the middle mode after feeling warm and if you feel overheated, switch to the fan mode to spread warm air to feel fresher. [The Quite & Warm Company When You Sleep] Are you worried that the space heater would adversely affect your sleep? With Air Choice small space heater, you will have a quiet sleep since you can time the thermostat from 1 to 12h with the timer function, and the small room heater will turn off automatically as setting. The thermostat keeps our electric space heater at a pleasant temp from 50 to 95℉ all night and helps save energy and money. [Safe & Reliable Protections] This ETL-certified oscillating heater is made of professional fire-retardant materials, and features multiple secure protections, so that you can use our portable electric heater with kids and pets in confidence. Tip-over and overheating protections will automatically turn off our efficient space heater avoiding accidents. Note: For your safety, please be sure to plug the room heater into the wall socket because of the high power. [Convenient to Use & Compact] With the size of 21 1/4\" L & 8 1/4\" W, this space heater for indoor use is compact and can be put anywhere, even on your office desk. You can remotely control this portable heater (within the 16ft range). Meanwhile, this portable heater for indoor use provides you with storage space for the remote control, so you can say goodbye to fishing around the remote control. At 4lbs weight, this small oscillating heater is super portable and is easy to move with a handle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iIYTIovUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Air Choice","source_asin":"B0B6VN57JC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6VN57JC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6VN57JC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
