window.products.push({"id":513265,"name":"Celery Juicer Machines Easy To Clean,Electric Cold Press Juicer Extractor Leafy Greens Wheatgrass Beet,Quiet Vegetables and Fruits Juicer 250W Motor,R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nLjxKt56L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Retain The Most Nutrients】LUFVEBUT slow juicers adopt 250W high torque copper brushless motor, easy to squeeze soft and hard ingredients, less than 80rpm, no damage to juice cells, reduce the air in the juice, reduce oxidation, more delicious; upgraded juicing system, the distance between the auger and the filter screen is reduced, more than 40% smaller than the ordinary product pressing distance, so that the juice taste more delicate, more nutrient retention. 【Real High Juice Yield】Your personal juicer uses cold press technology that work at much slower speeds to squeeze fruits and vegetables. 7-segment masticating spiral system, slowly cut, break, grind and extract the most juice, from pineapple to ginger. 3-stage fine filter screen holes, strain the extracted juice again. This well-designed juicer will provide higher juice yield, drier pulp, and smoother, less foamy juice.Slower speed and lack of heat make it quieter than centrifugal models. 【Healthy Living】Purpose-built for home juicing and family health. Whether for kids who do not like to eat vegetables, elderly people who cannot chew easily, pregnant women who have early pregnancy reactions, or for people who are losing weight and getting in shape, you can easy absorpt various vitamins and minerals from the homemade fresh and original juice. No tools required, easy assembly and disassembly. Removable components, water rinse and clean, dishwasher safe. 【Juicing Versatility】Compared with manual juicers' limitation in the type and quantity of juice they can produce, the multi-functional juicers can do more, save you time and hassle. Soft Mode easily extract juice from tomato, watermelon, orange, grape, cucumber and more. Hard Mode easily handles celery, wheatgrass, apple, pomegranate, pear, carrot, beets, ginger, kale and more. Small feeder chute and 0-blade design design, prevent children from being injured during the juicing. 【Manufacturer's Advantage】Professional R&D and Manufacturing, implement strict quality standards and testing processes, all products pass ETL/GS certification. All detachable parts are made of high-quality materials and are BPA-free, safe to use. Using a more glossy and textured piano baking lacquer housing, instead of cheap plastic. We offer 2-Year warranty. Don't worry about missing the return window, any time you are not satisfied with it, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nLjxKt56L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUFVEBUT","source_asin":"B0BLC55YZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLC55YZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLC55YZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
