window.products.push({"id":513309,"name":"YSOHQ Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer Fits Sandwich Bag for Drawer Kitchen Organization Food Storage Bag Container Organizer Bamboo 1 Box 4 Slots Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aedawp+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍩[NATURAL MATERIAL] The Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer is made of 100% high-hardness durable and sustainable bamboo, finely polished by hand! The bag is Organic Painted inside and outside.with two layers of varnish on the surface that are smooth and safe to use for kitchen carbinets and wall. 🍨[OPENING APPEARANCE] the bag can be opened directly to store the plastic bags and can be opened for easy filling of ziplock bags of different sizes. The bag is designed with a lock, which puts in plastic packaging, aluminum foil and wax paper, perfectly designed with a best sealing. No more searching through a messy drawer for that one elusive baggie – now everything is at your fingertips! 🍕[1 PIECE BOX WITH 4 SLOTS] This organizer offers different ways of organizing plastic wraps cuz four different size compartment. Organize your plastic bags like a pro! The QUART SLOT IS ENLARGED wider than the normal. After a deep research, we designed a lattice that fits the quart bag, and solves space shortage problems. It is the perfect fit for storing gallon, quart, sandwich, and snack size plastic bags. All insider dimensions is as follows: Quart bag organizer (8.23\"x3.74\"), Snack bag organizer (5.9\"x2.8\"), Sandwich bag organizer(5.9\"x2.8\"), Gallon bag organizer(9.45\"x 2.8\") 🍒[STYLISH COLORS] - Three color of your choice with thoughtful design and stylish. Color shades and styles fits into different spaces & lifestyles. Identify drawer contents instantly with the name on the box; You can label the organizer clearly, or not use the labels to keep the clean look of the bamboo holder. Maximize your kitchen space, time, and effort and enjoy a better cooking experience. 🍰[No Assembling Needed] The Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer is designed with mounting holes in the back panel just in case you want to hang it on a wall or the side of your kitchen cabinet. There are free card slots and nails. Our bamboo organizer box comes fully assembled and easy to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aedawp+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YSOHQ","source_asin":"B0B1J84TMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1J84TMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1J84TMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
