window.products.push({"id":513406,"name":"Oaken-Cat Down Alternative Comforter Duvet King - Ultra-Soft 3D-Air Breathable Fabric, All Season 3-Piece Cloud Plush Diamond Shape Quilted Microfiber","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W815TXARL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester 💤 YEAR-AROUND COMFORT - The KING size comforter is 106x90 inches, 270 gsm (~55oz) fill weight, all seasons microfiber comforter. Filled just right amount of a luxurious plush, down-like and bio-based microfiber filling, our all season down alternative comforter set is truly fluffy, ultra-soft, lightweight, breathable, cozy- everything you need for your all years dreamy night’s sleep. 💤 ULTRA-SOFT AND COZY - Crafted from extremely soft 120gsm microfiber polyester fabric, Reversible design: one side is 3D-air bubble embossing for extra breathable, and one side is light brushed & pre-washed for extra softness. 💤 SLEEP IN CLOUD - Our down alternative comforter use a sustainable ClimaLoft microfiber, which is earth-friendly derived from renewable sources, can helps to create an air layer for better circulation and allows the microfill absorb moisture and sweat quickly, cleverly regulate your temperature to keep you cool, dry and warm - whatever the weather. It provide a subtle cosy sleep zone and keep you in deep sleep more time. 💤 INTIMATE DESIGN - Feature a diamond box stitch to contain the fill and prevent shifting or bunching--never any clumping or cool spots. Quilted with the elegant premium 8mm Piped Edges, it not only looks beautiful but also ensures strength and durability. 4 corner loops anchor duvet cover tight to minimize shifting for utmost comfort. The easy-care microfiber is machine washable and dryable. 💤 EASY USE - Noise-Free and more Breathable, NO Tearing or Horrible Odor. Compliant to GRS and OEKO-Tex Standard 100. Come with brand new package, please air and spread it at first time use. Use it as a stand-alone comforter or comforter insert with your favorite duvet cover. 100-days return and replacement guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W815TXARL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oaken-Cat","source_asin":"B0871FV21G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0871FV21G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0871FV21G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
