window.products.push({"id":513591,"name":"Sage Haven The Alma Bouquet - 75 Pcs Pampas Grass，Natural Dried Grass for Flower Arrangements Home Decor / 30 White Pampas, 15 Natural Bunny 20 Reed &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711g1VoeT-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural dried fluffy pampas grass has a slight natural grass smell. Get the beauty of a natural arrangement, without any of the maintenance of fresh cut flower—no need water, add soil or nutrients! Natural dry pampas never wither! Can be placed anywhere in the house as a decoration and will infuse your indoor space with nature's beauty and charm. [PAMPAS BOUQUET ELEMENTS] Selected high-quality 75 piece dried, natural pampas grass bouquet, contains 30Pcs* White Pampas Grass + 20Pcs* White Reed Pampas + 15Pcs* Natural Dried Bunny Tails Grass + 5Pcs* Dried Natural Oat. [DRIED PAMPAS HEIGHT] Total length of dried pampas grass is about approximately 17-18 inches (45cm). [CARE INSTRUCTIONS / TIPS - MAKE IT FLUFF] After unpacking, put the pampas floral arrangement in a small/medium-sized vase, then set outside under the sun for few hours to make the pampas “bloom” or use a hairdryer on low-power cold air to blow the bouquet from a distance of ~4 inches to help fluff the bouquet. However, the BEST WAY is under sun! [ABOUT FLUFF SHEDDING] Shedding is normal especially when unpacking the bouquet because this is a natural dried plant. However, shedding will be minimal once you place in vase. (Optional) Once placed in a vase, you can lightly mist the arrangement with hairspray to hold fluffiness and reduce shedding! [ELEGANT HOME/OFFICE/MIXED-USE SPACE DECOR] The Alma bouquet is a simple and elegant fluffy dried-pampas grass bouquet this is great for DIY chic floral arrangement, picnic bouquet, DIY door garlands, Christmas decor, woodland country decor. Suitable for home, wedding, living room, office, party, garden, hotel, farmhouse, boho décor, etc. [About the Alma Bouquet] Bring the outside, inside! This bouquet combines natural (not faux) dry pampas grass, reed pampas, bunny tails and natural oat into one beautiful arrangement. Enhance your modern, boho, eclectic or minimalist themed spaces by adding this natural floral bouquet into your favorite small/ medium-sized vase. Why spend hundreds of dollars replacing fresh cut flowers when you can enjoy this longer-lasting and beautifully preserved arrangement!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711g1VoeT-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sage Haven","source_asin":"B09QJB68D7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QJB68D7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QJB68D7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
