window.products.push({"id":513609,"name":"Father's Day Gifts for Men Dad, Kollea 30.4 Oz Globe Whiskey Decanter Set with 7 Color RGB Light, Cool Liquor Dispenser with 2 Glasses for Home Bar, U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QICT1gJZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RGB Light With 10 Different Modes: The globe decanter set has a unique design than your normal decanters. It comes with 7 different colors and 10 different light modes. You can select any of the 7 colors or choose to set it in different modes to set the environment Elaborate & Elegant Design: This gorgeous globe shape decanter is a piece of art to illuminate your space. A global map is outlined on the decanter along with a rocket that is set to launch on the inside of the decanter. It’s carefully designed to bring elegance into your space Experience the Globe: The rotating globe decanter will give you the experience of a lifetime. You will remember every pour from it. It will also be a conversation starter for you when you people over for a drink and party. Enjoy the globe in the palm of your hand Gift that Never Disappoints: The globe whiskey decanter comes with a decanter that can hold up to 900ml/30.4oz of liquor and two glasses with a capacity of 300ml/10.2oz. Don’t forget the RGB lights that will light up anyone's mood in a second. This is a perfect gift for your loved one or your acquaintance High-Quality Material & Safely Packaged: The whiskey decanter is made from lead-free glass molded from a single piece that is not prone to bending and breaking. You can store your preferred liquor without any worries. It is also packed with an attractive black color gift box that is packed with safety in mind. With a non-fluffing black pearl cotton lining on the interior, it sure is a great choice for a gift without the mess of the foam crumbs from traditional packaging","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QICT1gJZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kollea","source_asin":"B0BHSR1KBR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHSR1KBR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHSR1KBR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
