window.products.push({"id":513633,"name":"Noa Store Plate Topper Universal Cake Topper Microwave Cover Leftover Lid Airtight #Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jtjX1mTVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Creates Airtight Seal, BPA Free Dishwasher Safe Top Rack Only Most effective on 12.5\"+ plates w/ raised edges dimensions Internal measurements: 5.75”h x 10”d base, 9”d at top conditions New listing includes: (1) Plate Topper Cake Topper, New description One major issue with desserts is keeping the baked goods fresh. Many desserts you make all have various sizes and you never seem to have a proper lid. This forces you to toss on a messy unsecure layer of tinfoil or plastic wrap. The cake topper solves this issue by creating an airtight lid on many plates by simply pressing it down. It works great as a microwave cover too just make sure use quick release tab vent it and open it up. This allows guest and partygoers to grab the food easily and seal it just as quick, keeping it fresh for all.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jtjX1mTVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Noa","source_asin":"B017RHKILE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017RHKILE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017RHKILE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
