window.products.push({"id":513636,"name":"Ramesses Penguin Fleece King Sheets- Brushed Cozy Flannel for Extra Softness, 4 pcs Flannel Sheet Set with 16 inches Deep Pocket (Taupe, King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710NZWAXybL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Seriously Soft and Cozy Plush- We call these sheets as Penguin Fleece Sheet cause the material is super cozy and plush, feel like comfy fleece and softer than polar fleece sheets. Putting these super-duper soft Penguin Fleece Sheet you will get a snuggly plush bed, a bed of stuffed pelt kind of fuzzy. Enjoy the incredible snuggle quality of these penguin fleece sheets. Fuzzy Warm Sheets- These Penguin Fleece Sheets will be your favorite winter sheets. Our Penguin fleece sheets are heating fibre also have excellent thermal insulation performance, your bed will be so warm and inviting in the winter time. The penguin fleece fabric is very skin friendly, soft and cuddly, that making you feel different softness and warmth. In winter, such a fleece bed wraps your whole body like a soft cloud, which can make you sleep till morning. Definitely a must have during the cold winter season. Premium Quality Fabric- Our Penguin Fleece sheets are made of ultra soft jersey knit, that is wrinkle resistant, non pilling, non shrinking, non fading, feature with good moisture absorption and good breathability. We use double stitched for improve the durability. King Sheet Set Includes- 1 Flat Sheet: 108\"W x 102\"L, 1 Deep Pocket Fitted Sheet: 78\"W x 80\"L + 16\"D, 2 King Pillowcases: 20\"W x 40\"L Easy Care- Machine washable on gentle cycle. Tumble dry on low heat or line dry. Fade-resistant and quick-drying, Wrinkle Free, no ironing needed and the product will get softer with each wash. We suggest you'd better wash the dark and light cloth separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710NZWAXybL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ramesses","source_asin":"B0BCF2DRJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCF2DRJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCF2DRJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
