window.products.push({"id":513678,"name":"Extra Large Silicone Placemat 23.6\" by 15.7\" Plus Flexible Place Mat Non Slip Waterproof Heat Stain Scratch Resistant for Kitchen Dining Table White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417B2WYdK4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎯【Versatile Kitchen Mat】 This Silicone Placemat can solve multiple problems. Great for catching messes. Protect counters from spills, scratches, grease, coffee stains, or damage. Place hot items of all sizes directly on the mat without having to dig through the drawer for a hot pad and no more need for trivets. Reduce the noises made by appliances. 🎯【Food-Grade Silicone Placemats】 The Silicone Placemat is made of food grade silicone which can directly contact food. BPA free. Does not absorb odors, kids and baby use friendly. It is reusable and environmental. 🎯【Non-Stick & Easy to Clean】 Made of Silicone material. 100% Waterproof, soft, no noxious odor. No longer mind messy spills during dining. Extra-durable and Upgrade Thickness resist fading and lasts for years with daily use. 🎯【Anti-Slip & Heat Resistant】 Large table mat heat resistant between -40°F to 446°F, can protect your tabletop from warm plates and bowls. Protect your table from scratches and stains and reduces noise from flatware. No need to worry about items slipping off the countertop. Tools will keep in place. Even if you are rolling dough hard on it, the mat won't slide. 🎯【Cut to Any Size You Want】 Very flexible, easy to fold and store in a small space. It also can be cut into any shape you want. When opening the box for the first time, if the placemat has a smell. Please wipe quickly, the smell will go away soon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417B2WYdK4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saunana","source_asin":"B0B8CWWZBV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8CWWZBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8CWWZBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":513679,"name":"Honey-Can-Do BTH-05079 3-Tier Metal Bathroom Shelf Space Saver, 9.45 x 22.83 x 59.84, Chrome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g7OT-2HOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you ever considered the storage value of the space *over* things? This shelving unit was designed to utilize valuable real estate over the toilet in the bathroom, but it can be used to increase storage space in any room. Try standing it over an end table to display books and knick knacks. Put it over a clothes hamper and keep laundry supplies nearby. It also would work over a dog crate—putting leashes, toys, and treats at hand. Anywhere you put it, you’ll get three shelves of additional storage that you didn’t have before—making this a truly valuable addition to your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g7OT-2HOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honey-Can-Do","source_asin":"B00R3FTLMI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00R3FTLMI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00R3FTLMI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":513680,"name":"BODUM Twin Dual Salt and Pepper Grinder, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515sbqGF-RL._AC_SL1009_.jpg","description":"The Bodum twin combo salt and pepper grinder spices up kitchen counters and dinner tables alike. With one easy turn of the colorful silicone band that serves as a non-slip handle, the twin switches between salt and pepper. Its powerful ceramic gears make this manual grinder extremely easy to use, especially because of clear compartments showing when the grinder needs to be refilled. The new twin comes in eight beautiful colors and does not require batteries to operate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515sbqGF-RL._AC_SL1009_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B002LARCN0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002LARCN0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002LARCN0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
