window.products.push({"id":513911,"name":"HYDERMUS Hat Rack for Wall with Shelf for 24 Baseball Caps Metal Hat Organizer with 12 Clips and 12 Hook Hat Holder Wall Mounted for Baseball Caps Tru","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71whOSj0N+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hat Racks for 24 Baseball Caps — Include 12 rust-resistant metal clips and 12 S-shaped hooks which can hold up to 24 different styles caps. Instead of fixed clips / hooks, ours clips and S hooks are removable so that you can adjust the distance and number of hooks to achieve the best fit. Versatile Hat Hanger for Different Style Hats — Comes with 12 metal clips and 12 S hooks, perfect for vary styles hats, such as baseball caps, trucker hat, snapback, sun visor hat, brim hat and more, even the it could be a sunglass organizer for wall. Nice organizer system at bedroom, entryway, laundry or cloakroom；Definately a good choice for who has many hat. Due to the tightening design for the end of S hook which makes it locked with metal bar better ,the S hook won't fall down when taking the hat. What's more, the metal bar could be a sunglass organizer if you got some sunglasses. A Rustic Wood Shelf for Display — Comes with a solid wood shelf with hand-made weathered walnut finish, which features rustic style and clear wood texture, the shelf measured about 16.5 x 4.8 inch with edge to prevent falling off. Install them on wall to display your collectibles, pictures frames, sunglasses, plants, decor accents and more, which will goes well with your home. Compact Design Save More Closet Space — Comes with 2 metal bars with a shelf which organize 24 caps and display what you want, just take up small space and prefect for narrow space or small apartment, this baseball cap organizer is a perfect storage tool for caps and hats storage, reduce clutter at your closet. High Quality Hat Holder — This hat storage made of wood and iron, sturdy and durable, rust-resistant metal clips and S-shaped hooks will not rust and NO marks on your hats and can be used for a long time. Ideal Gift for the People Who has many Hats-No more looking for hats lying around the house, this hat hooks perfect for all kinds of hats, definately a good gift to your husband, boyfriend, father, grandfather on birthday, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Father's Day or New Year. No-Nonsense Customer Service - Any questions about products or services will be answered within 24 hours. You don’t have to worry about returns, because we provide a LIFE-TIME warranty even if the Amazon return window is closed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71whOSj0N+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HYDERMUS","source_asin":"B0BB8964ZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-513911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB8964ZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB8964ZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
